<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues set for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Averill Park Central School District, N.Y., $21.665 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Pflugerville, Texas, $1.8 million certificates of participation.</p>
<p>--White Settlement, Texas, $2.045 million tax bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
